{"RukuNumber":230,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":51,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞وَقَالَ ٱللَّهُ لَا تَتَّخِذُوٓاْ إِلَٰهَيۡنِ ٱثۡنَيۡنِۖ إِنَّمَا هُوَ إِلَٰهٞ وَٰحِدٞ فَإِيَّـٰيَ فَٱرۡهَبُونِ","TajweedText":"۞ وَقَالَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ لَا تَتَّخِذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَيْنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ثْنَيْنِ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَا هُوَ إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>هٌ و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>حِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>دٌ‌ۖ ف</tajweed>َإِيَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ىَ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>رْهَب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٥١</span>","End":"٥١","PageNumber":272,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":230,"MaqraNumber":109,"HizbNumber":28,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":52,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَهُۥ مَا فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَلَهُ ٱلدِّينُ وَاصِبًاۚ أَفَغَيۡرَ ٱللَّهِ تَتَّقُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مَا فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ وَلَهُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دِّينُ وَاصِبًا‌ۚ أَفَغَيْرَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ تَتَّق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٢</span>","End":"٥٢","PageNumber":272,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":230,"MaqraNumber":109,"HizbNumber":28,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":53,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text