ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":230,"MaqraNumber":109,"HizbNumber":28,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":56,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَيَجۡعَلُونَ لِمَا لَا يَعۡلَمُونَ نَصِيبٗا مِّمَّا رَزَقۡنَٰهُمۡۗ تَٱللَّهِ لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ عَمَّا كُنتُمۡ تَفۡتَرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَيَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عَلُونَ لِمَا لَا يَعْلَمُونَ نَصِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بًا م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا رَزَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ‌ۗ تَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ لَتُسْــَٔلُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ عَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا كُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تَفْتَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٦</span>","End":"٥٦","PageNumber":273,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":230,"MaqraNumber":109,"HizbNumber":28,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":57,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَيَجۡعَلُونَ لِلَّهِ ٱلۡبَنَٰتِ سُبۡحَٰنَهُۥ وَلَهُم مَّا يَشۡتَهُونَ","TajweedText":"وَيَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عَلُونَ لِلَّهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ سُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed>‌ۙ وَلَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>َّا يَشْتَه<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٧</span>","End":"٥٧","PageNumber":273,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":230,"MaqraNumber":109,"HizbNumber":28,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":58,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِذَا بُشِّرَ أَحَدُهُم بِٱلۡأُنثَىٰ ظَلَّ وَجۡهُهُۥ مُسۡوَدّٗا وَهُوَ كَظِيمٞ","TajweedText":"وَإِذَا بُشِّرَ أَحَدُه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نث</tajweed>َىٰ ظَلَّ وَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>هُهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مُسْوَد<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ًّا و</tajweed>َهُوَ كَظ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٥٨</span>","End":"٥٨","PageNumber":273,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":230,"MaqraNumber":109,"HizbNumber":28,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":59,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَتَوَٰرَىٰ مِنَ ٱلۡقَوۡمِ مِن سُوٓءِ مَا بُشِّرَ بِهِۦٓۚ أَيُمۡسِكُهُۥ عَلَىٰ هُونٍ أَمۡ يَدُسُّهُۥ فِي ٱلتُّرَابِۗ أَلَا سَآءَ مَا يَحۡكُمُونَ","TajweedText":"يَتَو<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>رَىٰ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَوْمِ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن س</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُو</tajweed>ٓءِ مَا بُشِّرَ بِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ‌ۚ</tajweed> أَيُمْسِكُهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> عَلَىٰ هُونٍ أَمْ يَدُسُّهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>تُّرَابِ‌ۗ أَلَا س<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ مَا يَحْكُم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٩</span>","End":"٥٩","PageNumber":273,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":230,"MaqraNumber":109,"HizbNumber":28,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":16,"SurahIndex":"016","VerseNumber":60,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لِلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤۡمِنُونَ بِٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ مَثَلُ ٱلسَّوۡءِۖ وَلِلَّهِ ٱلۡمَثَلُ ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰۚ وَهُوَ ٱلۡعَزِيزُ ٱلۡحَكِيمُ","TajweedText":"لِلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخِرَةِ مَثَلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّوْءِ‌ۖ وَلِلَّهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَثَلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَعْلَىٰ‌ۚ وَهُوَ <tajweed class=h